Basalt OS repository signing key: PLACEHOLDER.

This file is replaced at build time with the real public key
(BASALT_GPG_PUBKEY, see scripts/build-rpms.sh). The release key does not
exist yet; lab builds embed a development key that lives only on the lab
host. A basalt-release package built with this placeholder cannot verify
the Basalt OS repository, so dnf will refuse its packages.
